{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b94c08df-c044-40f2-8027-d3024a4983df",
    "name": "FulfillTrack API",
    "description": "---\n\n**Cómo usar esta colección**\n\n1. Ejecutar el request Auth → Login con las credenciales deseadas.\n    \n2. Copiar el accessToken de la respuesta.\n    \n3. En la colección, ir a Variables y pegar el valor en la variable token.\n    \n4. Todos los demás requests usarán ese token automáticamente.\n   \n\nNotas\n\n- Reemplazar los UUID_XXX en las URLs con los UUIDs reales obtenidos de los listados.\n    \n- base_url por defecto: [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/ingresar",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "ingresar"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrarse",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"juanperez\",\n  \"password\": \"pass123\",\n  \"email\": \"juan@empresa.com\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Juan\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Perez\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/registrarse",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "registrarse"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
